Hello,

This patch makes NetHack occasionally create underground rivers,
either water or lava, in the dungeons of doom below level 13.
The code doesn't check for blocking the way, so there's a chance
you might need either cross the river or dig around it to get
to the stairs.  Special rooms are not affected by the river.
Does not invalidate bones or saves.

